<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ballarat first half profit up 35 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ballarat first half profit up 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>six months ended November 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  2.65 vs   1.94</p>
<p>    Net profit			  1.80 vs   1.33</p>
<p>    Sales				 7.38 vs   2.87</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		  4.0  vs   3.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Ballarat Brewing Ltd is a tourism and gaming operator and is subject to takeover bids from 41.6 percent shareholder Foster's Brewing Group Ltd and Guinness Peat Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
